# Pairs with EpochMeetsCoreClaim (E -> C). The claim raise loses its floor check, so an
# activation that survived the purge unclaimed raises an epoch L's clear retired and is not
# the current activation the core makes it.
MODULE: EpochMeetsCoreClaimRetiredEpochRaised
TARGET: EpochMeetsCoreClaim
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: E's claim raise admits an epoch L's clear retired

--- FIND
        /\ ERaiseAboveEntry(e)
        /\ ERaiseAboveFloor(e)
--- REPLACE
        /\ ERaiseAboveEntry(e)
--- END
